<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Gibson's says Pivot raises cash bid.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Gibson's says Pivot raises cash bid.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour and stockfeed miller Gibsons Ltd said on Friday that Pivot Nutrition Pty Ltd had increased its takeover bid by 20 cents per share to A$6.20.</p>
<p>Gibsons said its independent directors now recommended acceptance of the bid.</p>
</text>
